  "description": "Kwak Hajun, an Alpha and the second son of an extremely wealthy chaebol family. Despite his privileged life, he develops erectile dysfunction and, after searching for a solution, finds a doctor named Eunseok. However, Eunseok’s treatment is far from conventional. He discovers that Hajun responds strongly to pain, humiliation, and being dominated, gradually revealing a side of Hajun that even Hajun himself seems unaware of. Their encounters develop into an intense Alpha × Alpha power struggle, with Eunseok taking control and Hajun becoming increasingly drawn into the dynamic despite his anger and resistance.\nSource: MU",
